  "name": "Bering Sea Climate Space and Time Series",
  "description": "Data cover the period from 1958 - present and were complied from the NCEP/NCAR analysis: windstress curl, wind stress, heat flux, wind mixing, low-level cloud cover. An NPMR project\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Data collected to support the NPMR project \"Modes of Climate Change for the Bering Sea\"",
